@startuml
title 数字银行模拟系统——交易模块用例图
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor "客户\nACT-C" as C
actor "授权运营人员\nACT-O" as O
actor "模拟资金渠道\nACT-F" as F
actor "模拟外部银行\nACT-B" as B
rectangle "数字银行模拟系统 / 交易模块" {
  usecase "UC-TR-01\n存款" as DP
  usecase "UC-TR-02\n取款" as WD
  usecase "UC-TR-03\n行内转账" as IT
  usecase "UC-TR-04\n跨行转账" as XB
  usecase "UC-TR-05\n查询交易结果" as RES
  usecase "UC-TR-06\n查询交易流水" as LOG
  usecase "UC-TR-07\n下载交易回单" as RECEIPT
  usecase "UC-TR-08\n核对待确认交易" as CHECK
  usecase "UC-TR-09\n重试资金恢复" as RECOVER
  usecase "执行交易风控检查\n（公共子用例）" as RISK
}
C -- DP
C -- WD
C -- IT
C -- XB
C -- RES
C -- LOG
C -- RECEIPT
O -- RES
O -- LOG
O -- RECEIPT
O -- CHECK
O -- RECOVER
DP -- F
WD -- F
CHECK -- F
XB -- B
CHECK -- B
DP ..> RISK : <<include>>
WD ..> RISK : <<include>>
IT ..> RISK : <<include>>
XB ..> RISK : <<include>>
note bottom of RES
  requestId 仅定位原业务，不替代权限。
  提交响应丢失可凭本人原 requestId 查询。
end note
note bottom of RECOVER
  仅恢复有明确失败依据的 RECOVERING 交易。
  外部未知不得退款，外部成功仅补本地完成。
end note
note bottom of RISK
  内部风控检查不是系统外参与者；
  不把公共校验步骤计作基本用例。
end note
@enduml
